---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-tag">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      Available for remote contracts
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Senior Software Engineer</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      8 years building native and cross-platform mobile applications (iOS and Android) across fintech, crypto, logistics, and public security.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
      <a href="#experience" class="btn-ghost">See my work ↓</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>d.bohatyrchuk@gmail.com</span>
      <span class="sep">·</span>
      <span>Kraków, Poland</span>
      <span class="sep">·</span>
      <span>EEA / Remote</span>
      <span class="sep">·</span>
      <span>Open to US timezones</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-lines" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="line"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(var(--grid-line) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid-line) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 48px 48px;
}
.hero-lines {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-evenly;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}
.line {
  width: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--border) 30%, var(--border) 70%, transparent);
  opacity: .5;
}
.hero-inner {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  width: 100%;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.hero-tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  color: var(--accent);
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent-dim);
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: var(--bg);
}
.dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--accent);
  animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: .3; }
}
.hero-title {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
  line-height: 1.05;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  letter-spacing: -.02em;
}
.hero-sub {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--text-2);
  max-width: 520px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  font-weight: 300;
}
.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.btn-primary {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 12px 28px;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: var(--bg);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 500;
  border-radius: 4px;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: opacity .2s;
}
.btn-primary:hover { opacity: .85; }
.btn-ghost {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 12px 28px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  color: var(--text-2);
  font-size: 13px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  background: var(--bg);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color .2s, border-color .2s, background .2s;
}
.btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--text-3); }
.hero-meta {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-3);
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: .75rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent-dim);
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: var(--bg);
}
.sep { color: var(--border-strong); }
</style>
